  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-55c3d704599c5fef86e52e72",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "式 (3.68)、(3.72) 和 (3.73) 表征了无有限零点、具有一对共轭复数极点，且无阻尼自然振荡频率为 ω_n、阻尼比为 ζ、负实部为 σ 的系统的暂态响应。在分析与设计中，它们分别用于估计几乎所有系统的上升时间、超调量和调节时间。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Equations (3.68), (3.72), and (3.73) characterize the transient response of a system having no finite zeros and two complex poles and with undamped natural frequency ω_n, damping ratio ζ, and negative real part σ. In analysis and design, they are used to estimate rise time, overshoot, and settling time, respectively, for just about any system.",
